ents section, which displays the list of AI agents that users can select to chat with."},createAgentLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.create-agent-label",defaultMessage:"Create Agent",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the side navigation within the AI conversation interface that opens the agent creation interface. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it opens a dialog or form allowing users to create a new AI agent. The purpose is to provide users with a way to create custom AI agents from the side navigation."},chatListLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.chat-list",defaultMessage:"Chats",description:"Label text displayed as a section heading in the side navigation within the AI conversation interface, identifying the list of past chat conversations. Shown as a section title or heading. The purpose is to identify the chats section, which displays the user's conversation history."},closeSideNavLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.close-side-nav",defaultMessage:"Close",description:"Button label displayed on the close button in the side navigation within the AI conversation interface. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it closes or collapses the side navigation panel. The purpose is to provide users with a way to hide the side navigation to get more screen space for the main chat interface."},giveFeedbackLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.give-feedback",defaultMessage:"Give feedback",description:"Button label displayed on a feedback button in the side navigation within the AI conversation interface that opens a feedback form or dialog. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it opens a feedback interface allowing users to submit feedback about the AI assistant or the interface. The purpose is to provide users with a way to share their thoughts and help improve the product."},pulseLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-navigation.side-navigation.pulse",defaultMessage:"Insights",descri